{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026Amt1KQiLsn1784362041.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>運輸署：咪錶泊車系統故障，現未能提供服務，正進行搶修。</p><p></p><p>【運輸署公告】</p><p></p><p>運輸署今日（十一月三日）上午約八時二十分，接獲營運商報告咪錶泊車系統出現故障，現正緊急搶修。</p><p></p><p>署方已責成營運商從速跟進修復工作，將對駕駛人士的影響減至最低，並徹查事故原因及提交報告。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:06:52.485536+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:18:33.353426+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:02:31.855602+00:00","content_hash":"1a2a9c1eae2a25c853d52017f357c9889fcb3ea334e7e278038409d832958d44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:06:52.485536+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}